      "title": "Friday Squid Blogging: I Caught a Squid",
      "link": "https://www.schneier.com/blog/archives/2026/10/friday-squid-blogging-i-caught-a-squid.html",
      "published": "2026-10-09T20:24:45Z",
      "summary": "On Wednesday I spent a day fishing, on a small boat out of Gloucester, MA. We caught many cod (none of which we could keep), and a bunch of hake and mackerel (all of which we could keep). And&#8230;I caught a squid! Near as I can tell, it&#8217;s a longfin squid, sometimes called a Boston squid (Doryteuthis (Amerigo) pealeii).\nThat night I cooked it over a barbecue grill&#8212;hot and fast. Delicious.",
